text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', "As Circle of Protection: Art enters the battlefield, choose an artist.\\n{1}{W}: The next time a source of your choice with art by the chosen artist would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.\\n{1}{W}: Return Circle of Protection: Art to its owner's hand.", 'Choose a nonland card name, then reveal the top card of your library. If that card has the chosen name, you draw three cards.', 'Draw a card. Scry 2.', "Glacial Ray deals 2 damage to any target.\\nSplice onto Arcane {1}{R} (As you cast an Arcane spell, you may reveal this card from your hand and pay its splice cost. If you do, add this card's effects to that spell.)", 'Indestructible (Effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy this artifact.)\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Open a sealed Magic booster pack, reveal the cards, and put one of them into your hand. (Remove that card from your deck before beginning a new game.)', 'When you speak, sacrifice Goblin Mime.', 'You gain life equal to your age.', "{T}, Sacrifice Ashnod's Coupon: Target player gets you target drink. You pay any costs for the drink."]
flavor: ["Few remember the exploits of Dakkon's grandmother, Eunice Blackblade.", 'Limited time offer. Void where prohibited. Limit one per purchase. Valid only in participating duels. This coupon is nontransferable and invalid if shattered, crumbled, detonated, pillaged, or otherwise disenchanted. Cash value less than 1/20 of a cent. Offer not valid in Quebec, Rhode Island, or where prohibited by law or the DCI.', 'Make your judgment wisely: The right pack will let you defeat your nemesis, but a poor choice can only end in torment. And *Homelands*.', 'Mung noticed a few clouds gathering in the sky. Perhaps today he could perform his "walking against the wind" routine.', 'Statistically mind-staggering as it might seem, the term "mise" was in fact coined simultaneously by over one thousand Magic players.']
